    description: "For Rust library crates without [[bin]], hypergumbo selects fuzz targets, example binaries, or benchmark mains as entrypoints instead of pub fn/pub struct items from lib.rs. This renders forward slices useless for the actual library API surface. Affected: imara-diff, rodio, scap, tiktoken-rs, mermaid-rs-renderer, livekit-rust-sdks, client-sdk-js, candle."  # 1cf2
